---
import { getImageSrcset } from '../lib/image-variants';
import { getPublicImageDimensions } from '../lib/image-dimensions';

const image = '/assets/portfolio/260201_棚拍 RE/_I7A0019.webp';
const dimensions = await getPublicImageDimensions(image);
---

<section class="home-story editorial-section" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="home-story__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / THE IDEA</p>
    <h2 id="story-title">不只是拍照，<br />一起創造畫面。</h2>
    <p>從你的想法開始，找到舒服自在的拍攝方式。</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="home-story__media">
    <img
      src={image}
      srcset={getImageSrcset(image)}
      sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 44vw"
      alt="戴著耳機、穿著黑色皮衣的模特站在攝影棚中"
      width={dimensions?.width}
      height={dimensions?.height}
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption class="home-image-tag">
      <strong>耳機白日</strong>
      <span>棚拍・音樂主題 / 青春感</span>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
